# COOL Loop integration — soft service-token auth on /api/scrape and /api/scan-data
#
# Optional. Soft-auth behavior on those two endpoints:
#   - If COOLLOOP_SERVICE_TOKEN is unset            → all requests allowed (transition mode)
#   - If set, and request has no X-COOLLOOP-TOKEN   → request allowed (preserves widget traffic)
#   - If set, and X-COOLLOOP-TOKEN matches          → request allowed, tagged 'coolloop'
#   - If set, and X-COOLLOOP-TOKEN is wrong         → 403
#
# Set in Vercel dashboard for the deployed environment. Leave blank locally unless testing.
COOLLOOP_SERVICE_TOKEN=
